sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Restaurateur
    participant C as Service Clients
    participant O as Service Commandes
    participant P as Service Produits
    participant MQ as RabbitMQ
    U->>C: POST /api/auth/login/
    C-->>U: jeton JWT (access)
    U->>O: POST /api/orders/ + JWT
    O->>P: GET /api/products/{id}/ (existe ? stock ?)
    P-->>O: prix, stock
    O->>O: calcul du total, enregistrement
    O-)MQ: publie order.created
    O-->>U: 201 Commande créée
    MQ-)P: order.created
    P->>P: stock = stock - quantité
    P-)MQ: publie product.stock_updated
